==============================================================================
DATASET NOTICE & ATTRIBUTION
==============================================================================
This repository contains code for training, evaluating, and serving visual speech
recognition models. It does NOT redistribute the EGCLLC (Enhanced GRID Corpus
with Lip Landmark Coordinates) or GRID corpus audio/video data.

Users wishing to train or evaluate models on EGCLLC must independently obtain
and use the dataset in accordance with its respective licenses, terms of use,
and citations provided by the dataset authors (SilentSpeak/EGCLLC).
